    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFlowers for You\u201d is a gentle adventure game where you create custom bouquets based on each customer\u2019s story as a florist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in modern Japan, listen to faded memories and craft floral arrangements that bring color back into their lives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deliver your own bouquet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you receive an order, create your bouquet. The story will change depending on the bouquet you offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also enjoy the bouquets you created in the photo mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/94aa1293a03ae5344452c7909f395dc9.poster.avif?t=1753261232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/94aa1293a03ae5344452c7909f395dc9.webm?t=1753261232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/94aa1293a03ae5344452c7909f395dc9.mp4?t=1753261232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >People's stories intersect at the florist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people who visit your florist shop are all living with faded memories somewhere in their hearts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to their stories and touch their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/8e55b176ef39f19f2ed12d756f484fdc.poster.avif?t=1753261232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/8e55b176ef39f19f2ed12d756f484fdc.webm?t=1753261232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/8e55b176ef39f19f2ed12d756f484fdc.mp4?t=1753261232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tokyo, the capital of modern Japan. The stories of the people who live there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story diverges depending on the bouquet of flowers you offer, rather than on your choice of dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm illustrations in the style of a picture book and gentle colors create an immersive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lo-fi music that fits well with the peaceful atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game makes players think and feel. A game experience that soothes the mind and body.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The images are under development.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFlowers for You\u201d is a gentle adventure game where you create custom bouquets based on each customer\u2019s story as a florist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in modern Japan, listen to faded memories and craft floral arrangements that bring color back into their lives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deliver your own bouquet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you receive an order, create your bouquet. The story will change depending on the bouquet you offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also enjoy the bouquets you created in the photo mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/94aa1293a03ae5344452c7909f395dc9.poster.avif?t=1753261232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/94aa1293a03ae5344452c7909f395dc9.webm?t=1753261232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/94aa1293a03ae5344452c7909f395dc9.mp4?t=1753261232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >People's stories intersect at the florist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people who visit your florist shop are all living with faded memories somewhere in their hearts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to their stories and touch their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/8e55b176ef39f19f2ed12d756f484fdc.poster.avif?t=1753261232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/8e55b176ef39f19f2ed12d756f484fdc.webm?t=1753261232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/8e55b176ef39f19f2ed12d756f484fdc.mp4?t=1753261232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tokyo, the capital of modern Japan. The stories of the people who live there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story diverges depending on the bouquet of flowers you offer, rather than on your choice of dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm illustrations in the style of a picture book and gentle colors create an immersive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lo-fi music that fits well with the peaceful atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game makes players think and feel. A game experience that soothes the mind and body.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The images are under development.</p>",
